# VISUAL LOCK LAW — WRITING & FIXING

**Status: MANDATORY · NON-NEGOTIABLE** for every DeepSeek / writer / format-fix pass.

## DeepSeek / writers (text only)

Writers may change **prose, headings, FAQ, Sources, mermaid code** only.

Writers **must NOT**:
- Add, remove, move, or edit image markdown (`![alt](url)`), `@@PRODUCT`, HTML, `<aside>`, inline styles, or CRO cards
- Change layout, visual structure, or render-time widgets
- Stack two images back-to-back (text must sit between images)
- Invent image URLs

Enforcement: `_visual_lock_law.js` → `enforceWriterVisualLock()` after every DS pass. Prompt snippet: `VISUAL_LOCK_DS_SYSTEM_SNIPPET`.

## Images (swap only)

The **image pipeline** (`_ddg_facecard_lib.js`, `repairBrokenQaImages`, `fillEntryMissingImages`) may **swap** one applicable image for another at an **existing slot** — same count, same rhythm.

Images **must NOT**:
- Stack two images without text between
- Add extra image lines beyond what the template allows
- Use live `pollinations.ai` URLs in blobs (self-host to `/assets/qa/`)

DDG↔Pollinator alternation · **15s** floor (`_image_provider_alternate.js`).

## Render (desktop + mobile)

Renderer + `assets/pulse-tan.css` own all visuals:
- Real `<img>` tags; `max-width:100%`; `height:auto`; `width:100%` on entry figures
- Q&A: gold `direct-answer-box` at render; CRO injected at render — never in blob
- Mosaic tiles: `<img class="mm-img">` not background-image lazy load

Module: `_visual_lock_law.js` · wired in `_format_fixer_lib.js`, `_v2_components.js`, `_aq_qa_gold_fix_lib.js`.
